S1 | 001 | SYSBP | SystolicBP | SYSBPGT160
S1 | 002 | SYSBP | SystolicBP | SYSBPGT160
S1 | 003 | SYSBP | SystolicBP | SYSBPGT140
S1 | 001 | DIABP | DiastolicBP | DIABPGT90
